# ADR-76: `**/data` above keeps the API's sqlite files out of the build context, and it also silently excluded the
# incident corpus, which is a build artifact the agents image genuinely needs. Later patterns win, so this line
# puts that one directory back. Without it the risk-precedent listing is not offered at all.
!packages/agents/data
